{"id":"n66426-1-8","stage":2,"title":"쑤시다 · 刺痛","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66426-1-8-1","ko":"몸살은 좀 나았니?","zh":"浑身酸痛好些了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸살은","meaning":"浑身难受，过劳而病","explanation":"몸살：浑身难受，过劳而病；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"몸살","audio":"/audio/78bf29d1a4f75a6d621f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54741","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나았니?","meaning":"痊愈","explanation":"낫다：痊愈；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62354","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"78bf29d1a4f75a6d","term":"몸살","zh":"浑身难受，过劳而病","audio":"/audio/78bf29d1a4f75a6d621f.mp3","entryId":"54741","definition":"身体过度疲劳时，全身酸痛无力、发烧的病症。","pronunciation":["몸살"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"痊愈","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"62354","definition":"疾病或伤口等消失而恢复原样。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5febaf3b6333b3583597.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66426-1-8-2","ko":"아니, 아직도 온몸이 쑤셔.","zh":"没有，还是全身酸痛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"온몸이","meaning":"全身","explanation":"온몸：全身；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"온몸","audio":"/audio/53813a553060901e944c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67839","senseId":"1","lemma":"온몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쑤셔.","meaning":"刺痛，酸痛","explanation":"쑤시다：刺痛，酸痛；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"쑤시다","audio":"/audio/91758f65153658d67edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66426","senseId":"1","lemma":"쑤시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"53813a553060901e","term":"온몸","zh":"全身","audio":"/audio/53813a553060901e944c.mp3","entryId":"67839","definition":"身体全部。","pronunciation":["온ː몸"]},{"id":"91758f65153658d6","term":"쑤시다","zh":"刺痛，酸痛","audio":"/audio/91758f65153658d67edd.mp3","entryId":"66426","definition":"身体像用针刺一般疼痛。","pronunciation":["쑤시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d42f78e4650af07530ea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.231,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66426","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9563,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["浑身酸痛好些了吗？","没有，还是全身酸痛。","水里加的盐太多了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["浑身酸痛好些了吗？","没有，还是全身酸痛。","水里加的盐太多了。"],"answer":1}]}
